Cell["\<\
There are different options for the model we use in the cell directly right \
of the interface between the left and the right subdomains, in which a \
different number of moments is used. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9038550177270308`*^9, 3.9038551251558237`*^9}},
 FontSize->16,ExpressionUUID->"8d5ec97f-b240-458b-ac5c-453ed135bc88"],

