13ecb3b79967"],

Cell["\<\
Set parameters:
- Number of grid points in each part of the subdomain
- Boundaries of the physical domain\[LineSeparator]- Number of moments in the \
left and the right subdomain\[LineSeparator]- Set initial values\
\[LineSeparator]- Set relaxation time
\[LineSeparator]The model is then initialized by calling the InitializeModel \
function that takes the chosen parameters as arguments. To run the \
simulation, one more parameter is needed:\[LineSeparator]- Choose end time

Finally, one of the finite volume methods is called and one of the moments is \
dynamically plotted.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9041100256919513`*^9, 3.9041101123214607`*^9}, {
   3.904110165193872*^9, 3.9041102453289185`*^9}, 3.9041102921993165`*^9, {
   3.9041103528093405`*^9, 3.9041103628284254`*^9}, {3.904110425742777*^9, 
   3.9041104715142145`*^9}},
 FontSize->18,ExpressionUUID->"9953d698-4e7c-4289-a845-e4dc7270b57f"],

